                    <item name="Size" type_name="gh_single" type_code="5">12</item>
                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">One seed-3 log is cut into 16 blanks. Each blank keeps that cut as Stock Geometry so grain differs.
Lines map blank end to tower foot. Fibre and plane stay along each blank so cylinder ends do not remap the log field.
Blanks and tower start Textured. Right-click for Gradient or Force flow. The knot-influence disk uses the same log-sized field.</item>
